{
  "_note": "Operator-owned agent action catalog (agent spine Phase 1). The catalog IS the guardrail: the conversational agent can only be gated through actions defined here, at the policy tier the operator set (auto / confirm-once / always-confirm). Read at request time by server/agent_policy.py (env-overridable LEAF_AGENT_POLICY_FILE); strict-validated \u2014 unknown fields are load errors. tier_overrides may retune a tier's policy but can never loosen an action whose tenant_tightenable is false. Per-tenant overlays (agent_tenants.json beside this file) can only TIGHTEN.",
  "version": 1,
  "approval_ttl_s": 300,
  "rate_limits": {
    "low_per_hour": 120,
    "medium_per_hour": 60,
    "high_per_hour": 10
  },
